WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.510
Day 3

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.930
Excuse me. We made an appointment for an interview.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:07.280
Episode 37

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:07.280
Space Colony ARK Battle

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.290
Day 3

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.410
Your minions aren't very reliable.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.200
That's none of your business!

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:26.750
Well, I'll prepare the counterattack. Give me the password to control the colony.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:33.960
M-A-R-I-A. 'Maria'. I'm counting on you.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:37.340
I'll be on standby aboard Crazy Gadget.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.090
Deceiving that old man is a piece of cake.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.680
Now let me get to work.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.770
M-A-R-I-A...

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.270
Where's Project Shadow?

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.770
Here it is!

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.440
Let's see what it says.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.610
The ultimate creature development project…

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.950
Someone who must not exist...

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.080
Shadow? Secure and dispose?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.620
What does this mean?

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.130
Then who is he?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.510
He's here.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.970
Sonic?

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:25.010
He's come to die.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.430
Sonic won't lose!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:32.900
The answer will soon become clear whether what you believe in is correct or not.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.320
Leave!

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.280
I have nothing to say to the press!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:52.500
Please calm down. We're not planning to write a tabloid article.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.250
What happened at that colony 50 years ago?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.300
I don't know anything.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:05.220
Among the former members of GUN's special forces, you're the only person we could find.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.300
Please tell us what happened.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:11.100
You have no idea how dangerous this is!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.190
There's no point in digging into this now!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.060
But I still want to know the truth!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.900
Many people who were involved in this project lost their lives.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.280
Like my father…

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.280
Please help us!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.580
Or else, it'll be treated as if nothing happened!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.500
Scarlet.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:43.170
I'm sorry. I became too emotional.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.930
Don't worry about it.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.140
We just have to keep coming back to convince him.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.110
Scarlet, run as fast as you can to the car.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.150
Huh?

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.110
Hurry!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.280
Okay!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.780
Grab the woman!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.410
Who's next?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:15.750
You go!

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.590
What are you doing?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.890
Oh no!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.260
Let me go!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.810
Calm down!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.270
You're…

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.610
This way!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.410
I think we're safe now.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.160
Thank you very much.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.120
You sure are strong.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.750
I still work out at the gym.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.500
Besides, I don't want anyone else to die.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.780
Day 3

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.940
We have to approach carefully.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:23.320
Let's go to the opposite side.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.700
Stop the ship!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.740
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.040
The Master Emerald is nearby!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.670
Cut it out!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.930
They hit the tail.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.050
All right!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.020
I'll let you off the ship, so get out of the cockpit!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:59.350
Master Emerald!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:11.860
Intruder detected in Area M14.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.240
What are they doing?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.540
There it is!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.890
Nope. I won't let you have this gem.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.890
Give me back the Master Emerald!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.520
Sorry.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.320
Aren't you ashamed of being violent against a lady?

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.950
A lady doesn't steal other people's jewels!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.590
Are you all right?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.970
Get your hands off of me!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:19.770
How dare you say that when I just saved your life!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:26.440
You only saved me because you wanted to hold my hand, you pervert.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.190
You must be joking!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.070
Stop looking down on me!

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.490
You're so stupid.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:36.700
Move!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.620
Hey!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.370
I'll give it back to you.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.910
I don't need a jewel that reeks with the scent of echidnas.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.830
You should have done this in the first place!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.500
I'm sorry that I treated you so rough.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.680
It's about time that I leave.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.150
This place is desolate.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.150
This place has been shut down since the accident 50 years ago.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.280
We don't have that much time left!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:16.070
We have to hurry and destroy the weapon!

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.450
About that...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.280
A Chaos Emerald?

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:24.710
Chuck and I made it to power up the X-Tornado.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:32.590
Its power and purity is nowhere near the real thing, but it's made to absorb the energy of the Chaos Emerald and explode.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:37.380
Okay! I can use this to destroy the control system.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.610
What was that?

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:50.940
Tanaka?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:52.860
Amy!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.150
I've been waiting for you, Sonic.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.530
Give me that Chaos Emerald.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:03.790
Or else, she's going to die.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:08.170
I don't care.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.670
Sonic, what do you mean by that!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.250
Will you still not give up when I do this?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.880
It hurts!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.260
Fine.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.510
Put the Chaos Emerald in the center of the circle.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.270
You're actually acting like a real villain.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.310
I see you in a whole new light.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.730
I'll send you out into space and blow you up!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:39.360
Wait! I'll give you the real Chaos Emerald!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:43.330
What? You mean that Chaos Emerald is a fake?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:48.040
If it's fake, then I don't have to restrain myself.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.750
Stop! Let Sonic go!

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.380
Amy, take care.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.380
Sonic…

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.010
I leave the rest to you, Tails.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:04.140
Farewell, Sonic the Hedgehog!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.270
Sonic!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.570
Sonic…

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:30.460
Sonic!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.090
He was nothing more than an ordinary hedgehog after all.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.220
Sonic was inside?

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:48.930
Now you know that there's nothing in this world that's worth trusting.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:52.060
No way… Sonic couldn't have...

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.310
Sonic!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.290
Sonic…

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.170
Too bad for you, but he's gone.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.800
Now give me the last Chaos Emerald.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.760
Sonic…

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:29.180
That was the first time that Sonic asked me to handle things for him.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:36.400
So, I'm not going to run away!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.190
Amy and Tanaka, hide somewhere because it's going to dangerous!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:41.320
Amy, let's go.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:47.820
What can you do by yourself, you weak fox cub?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.670
How rude!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.420
Our mission was simple.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:04.420
There was an accident on ARK, so we were told to close the facility.

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:06.640
An accident?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:11.520
Everyone knew that was just an excuse.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.850
However, none of us were brave enough to question it.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:18.810
We followed orders and went into space.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:34.580
There were many rumors about ARK.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:42.550
Such as doing research for eternal life or creating the ultimate life form.

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.090
Stop!

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:53.350
After her! Don't let any of the staff escape!

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.190
An experimental life form?

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.730
She's planning to free it!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.570
Stop!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.950
Let go of the lever.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.410
Don't do anything stupid!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:18.920
Stop!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.830
Stop!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:27.170
All I wanted to do was stop her…

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.350
I didn't know where the pod went.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:42.400
Our mission ended when we sealed away the prototype of the ultimate life form.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.070
So that's what really happened 50 years ago.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:52.530
We got rid of the researchers who resisted, and it was all covered up as an accident.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:56.910
The girl's name was also on the list of victims.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:02.500
I volunteered for GUN because I wanted to be a hero that protects the peace.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:05.630
But in reality…

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.260
We won't let your feelings go to waste.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.660
Day 3

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.180
Sonic wouldn't die!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:24.480
I believe in you. So you have to come back!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.710
Sonic?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.460
Hey, pull yourself together!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.300
Knuckles?

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.300
I really was able to do it when I tried.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.560
Can I do it?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.350
Chaos Control!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.150
I shouldn't have underestimated it just because it's a replica.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.820
Are you all right?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:16.030
I'm worried about Tails and the others.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.160
Knuckles, can you watch them for me?

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.580
And what about you?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:25.920
I'm going to throw this right down the weapon's barrel!

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.550
Day 3

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.130
I see.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:36.890
Roger. I'm copying the data as we speak.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:41.390
It seems that destroying the Eclipse Cannon won't put an end to all the problems.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.940
Project Shadow…

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.530
It looks like there's something more going on.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:59.080
Eggman doesn't know the details either, but I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.330
You should retrieve the Chaos Emeralds and leave.

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.830
We'll analyze the data when you're back on land, Rouge.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.760
If you don't want to die, keep your hands off the Chaos Emeralds.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:16.930
You're the President's special agent Rouge the Bat.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.220
Did you check up on me?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.470
That's an invasion of privacy.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.390
I can say the same about you.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:30.190
I finished my job, so I'm taking what I came here to get and going home.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.440
You're an impostor.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.360
Which one of us is the real impostor?

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.700
What do you mean by that?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.250
This will finish you!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.840
Tails, are you all right?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.390
Sonic, I did it!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.640
Oh no! The Chaos Emerald!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:17.320
This is the progress report for Project Shadow, a plan to create the ultimate life form.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.870
The body they created is still held here.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.620
I know. That's a prototype.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.580
I'm the ultimate life form they created afterwards-

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:35.630
Two capsules were ejected when ARK was shut down.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.430
But neither was found.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:43.470
They couldn't lock up in Prison Island what they couldn't find.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.470
Do you understand?

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.810
I wonder who you really are.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.440
Shadow, I acquired all the Chaos Emeralds.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.570
Right.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:01.530
Someone is heading straight towards the Eclipse Cannon.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.160
It's going to fire very soon.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.200
I want you to go there.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.080
Do you actually believe that you're the real Shadow?

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:16.460
All your memories might be fake!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:23.550
Even if my memories are fake, that's all I have.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:27.560
All I care about is carrying out her wishes.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.400
Is he going after Sonic?

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.280
So Sonic is OK?

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.530
I'm so glad, Sonic.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.120
Chris!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.370
Hi, Tanaka.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.290
Chris!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:53.000
Chris. thank goodness you're okay.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.920
I'm sorry I made you worry, Tanaka.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:01.570
Day 3

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.590
I'm surprised.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:07.970
I thought that explosion turned you into space dust.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.520
Sorry, but I'm known for being stubborn.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.150
I was saved thanks to you.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:20.240
What? You were able to Chaos Control with that fake?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.280
I'm in a hurry, so I'll go on ahead!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:30.120
It seems your appearance isn't the only thing that's similar to me.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.370
Who are you?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.540
I'm me.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.290
I'm just an adventure-loving hedgehog. I'm Sonic the Hedgehog!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.550
I see.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.010
But I can no longer allow you to exist.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:47.140
Your adventures will now come to an end!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:53.310
Begin charging energy for Eclipse Cannon's second shot!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.270
Removing final safety mechanism!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:00.110
Vanish! Chaos Spear!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.700
Chaos Spear!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.290
What's he thinking?

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.090
The Eclipse Cannon!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.880
Sonic did it!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:30.640
Everything will be over as long as we get the Chaos Emeralds back!

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.230
Several parts of the Eclipse Cannon have been destroyed!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.690
What the heck is Shadow doing?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:39.110
Even the gun barrel is damaged!

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.400
What?

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.690
It doesn't matter! I'll still shoot!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:47.780
Move!

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:50.660
Eclipse Cannon, fire!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:10.930
Huh?

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.650
Gramps?

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:24.530
Chaos Spear!

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:31.660
I declare a death sentence on all mankind.

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.450
In 27 minutes and 53 seconds, ARK will crash into Earth.

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:41.670
You and Earth will die together.

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.010 --> 00:25:35.360
Maria's Request, Everyone's Request
